    "name": "Salesforce Bulk API 2.0 Abort Data Extensions API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Salesforce Bulk API 2.0 is a simplified, REST-based interface for bulk data operations that improves on the original Bulk API. It uses a straightforward job model and supports CSV format for ingest and query jobs, enabling processing of millions of records asynchronously.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Salesforce Developers",
